       "processing_note": "外為どっとコム「外為どっとコムの検索結果（2026-10-05）」（https://www.gaitame.com/media/entry/2026/10/04/060300）をもとに本サイト作成",
       "mark": "reported_unverified",
       "mark_reason": null
      },
      {
       "line_id": "L-001-08",
       "text": "政策金利が上がると、銀行が貸し出しに付ける金利も上がりやすい。",
       "claimed_mark": "explainer",
       "numbers": [],
       "source_ref": null,
       "excerpt": null,
       "attribution": null,
       "processing_note": null,
       "mark": "explainer",
       "mark_reason": null
      },
      {
       "line_id": "L-001-09",
       "text": "日本銀行が国債を買い入れる量を減らすと、長い期間の金利には上がる方向の力が働きやすい。",
       "claimed_mark": "explainer",
       "numbers": [],
       "source_ref": null,
       "excerpt": null,
       "attribution": null,
